WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:14.126
Tina: Over there!

2
00:00:14.146 --> 00:00:15.867
We’re saved!

3
00:00:15.887 --> 00:00:21.310
Danny: How are we saved?

4
00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:24.972
Tina: We just need to get over there, to higher ground.

5
00:00:24.992 --> 00:00:27.854
Brad: I wish your friend Hopian was here.

6
00:00:28.714 --> 00:00:30.075
He could tell us what to do!

7
00:00:33.292 --> 00:00:33.592
Danny: Ha-ha!

8
00:00:33.632 --> 00:00:34.913
Brad: What are you so happy about?

9
00:00:34.933 --> 00:00:38.255
Danny: Hopian already told me what to do!

10
00:00:38.275 --> 00:00:39.917
Brad: What was it?

11
00:00:39.937 --> 00:00:43.919
Danny: Imagination is the key, remember?

12
00:00:43.939 --> 00:00:48.102
Tina: So, how do we imagine our way over to the trees?

13
00:00:48.122 --> 00:00:50.324
Danny: I guess.

14
00:00:50.344 --> 00:00:52.525
Brad: I’ve got it!

15
00:00:53.226 --> 00:00:54.446
Think light thoughts!

16
00:00:54.466 --> 00:00:56.528
Danny: What do you mean?

17
00:00:56.548 --> 00:00:59.090
Brad: Think of the lightest thing you can.

18
00:00:59.110 --> 00:01:02.272
Brad: Imagine that you're a feather or something.

19
00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:04.461
Tina: It might work.

20
00:01:04.541 --> 00:01:06.943
Brad: Let me test it out.

21
00:01:13.247 --> 00:01:14.068
It’s working!

22
00:01:21.673 --> 00:01:24.895
Brad: I made it!

23
00:01:25.155 --> 00:01:25.636
I made it!

24
00:01:26.336 --> 00:01:27.537
We’re going to be safe.

25
00:01:27.557 --> 00:01:29.779
Danny: What did you think of?

26
00:01:29.799 --> 00:01:31.560
Brad: Marshmallows!

27
00:01:32.264 --> 00:01:34.645
I imagined that my feet were marshmallows!

28
00:01:34.665 --> 00:01:37.086
Danny: Now I’m hungry.

29
00:01:37.106 --> 00:01:40.007
Tina: It’s my turn!

30
00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:46.930
Good job!

31
00:01:47.130 --> 00:01:47.831
Keep going!

32
00:01:47.851 --> 00:01:53.153
Tina: That was easy.

33
00:01:53.653 --> 00:01:54.754
Great idea, Brad!

34
00:01:55.294 --> 00:01:56.314
It really works.

35
00:01:56.815 --> 00:01:58.976
Brad: Come on, Danny.

36
00:01:59.176 --> 00:01:59.756
Your turn.

37
00:02:01.632 --> 00:02:02.933
Danny: This’ll be easy!

38
00:02:02.953 --> 00:02:08.618
Tina: He’ll be here in no time!

39
00:02:09.139 --> 00:02:10.640
You’re really smart, Brad.

40
00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:11.821
Brad: Yeah.

41
00:02:12.221 --> 00:02:14.383
I didn’t even need my computer this time.

42
00:02:16.705 --> 00:02:20.668
Tina: Oh no!

43
00:02:20.728 --> 00:02:25.152
Brad: Danny!

44
00:02:25.613 --> 00:02:26.373
What’s happening?

45
00:02:26.393 --> 00:02:29.376
Danny: I was thinking of a balloon.

46
00:02:30.176 --> 00:02:33.158
Danny: Then I started to think of a baboon instead!

47
00:02:33.178 --> 00:02:37.080
Brad: Concentrate on the balloon!

48
00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:39.702
Danny: I’m trying!

49
00:02:44.345 --> 00:02:45.045
Let’s help him.

50
00:02:45.065 --> 00:02:49.808
Brad Tina: Balloon, balloon, balloon, balloon.

51
00:02:58.508 --> 00:02:59.937
Good job, Danny!
